      "content": "Thanks, that makes sense. To get a bit more specific, when you mention \"demographic shifts\" or \"changes in local commerce types,\" how do those actually translate to risk? Like, are there specific types of shifts in the resident population or even certain types of new businesses moving in that usually signal a neighborhood is becoming less stable or less reliable for a long-term commercial loan?",
